OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatches of cloud around during
OL,6,Fthe morning for Devon and Cornwall,
OL,7,Fbut otherwise a very sunny, dry day.
OL,8,FHowever, it will feel chilly with a
OL,9,Fnortheasterly breeze and temperatures
OL,10,Fa few degrees below the seasonal
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry and clear night ahead.
OL,14,FTemperatures will fall sharply
OL,15,Fovernight beneath long clear spells as
OL,16,Fwinds ease. A widespread frost is
OL,17,Fexpected, particularly inland and for
OL,18,Fthe moors.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
