OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA cold start, but dry and
OL,6,Fsunny throughout the day. Another
OL,7,Fchilly day, with temperatures a few
OL,8,Fdegrees below average for the time of
OL,9,Fyear, but only a light breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fand dry on Saturday, then cloudier on
OL,13,FSunday and Monday with patchy rain and
OL,14,Fshowers. Feeling cold with
OL,15,Ftemperatures remaining below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
